# init.recovery.usb.rc - intentionally EMPTY placeholder.
#
# OrangeFox/TWRP init.rc UNCONDITIONALLY imports /init.recovery.usb.rc even
# when TW_EXCLUDE_DEFAULT_USB_INIT := true (which is what stops the build from
# generating this file). A missing import target makes Android 9 init
# LOG(FATAL) and crash -> lk reloads recovery -> bootloop.
#
# USB gadget/adb logic on this device is already handled by
# init.recovery.mt6771.rc (configfs gadget). Keeping this file empty avoids
# duplicate ffs.adb config and still satisfies the import.
